{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Where's Danny? Has anybody seen Danny?","Somebody's missing, we lost someone","He was right behind me - where did he go?","Where's Danny?! Has anyone seen Danny?!","Wait, where did she go? She was right here a second ago","Oh no, oh no, we lost someone, who's missing? WHO'S MISSING?!","One of us isn't here, I'm counting, I'm counting again, no, no, we're short","Anybody seen Ruth? She was just behind me, swear to God"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=law",{"Where's my partner? Anyone seen him?","Unit missing, I need a headcount"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=swat",{"Headcount - one missing"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=military",{"Man missing! Anybody see him?","Headcount! Somebody's gone!"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=elite",{"One missing - search"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Where'd Rico go? He was right here","We're a man short - who's gone?","Where the hell is Tommy?!","Anyone seen Billy? BILLY?!","Where's Tommy?? Where the fuck is Tommy?!","Billy?? BILLY?? Don't tell me he ran off","Where the hell is Tommy? Did he run off?","Someone's missing, check the perimeter"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Where is she?! WHERE IS SHE?!","He was RIGHT behind me!! Where the hell'd he go?!","Oh God, did we leave him? Did we leave him behind?","Wait- wait- who's not here? Who's missing?","Danny?! DANNY?!","That's not right, count 'em again, somebody's missing!!","Ruth? Ruth, where are you? RUTH!","Where is she?? WHERE IS SHE?? She was right here!!","Wait- wait- one of us is missing, who is it, who's missing??","Don't tell me we lost somebody, don't tell me, please, don't tell me!","Where is he?! He's not anywhere, God, please let him be okay","Someone's gone, someone's gone, who's gone?"}},
{"MEMBER_MISSING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Hey, where's Earl? Anybody see Earl?","One of us is missing, goddamn it, who?","Count off, count off, who's gone?","Where the hell did she go?","We're short one, I can feel it, we're short","Where the hell did she go? Anybody see her?","Count off, count off, who's missing?","Earl?? Earl, where are you, you old fool?!"}},
