{"MORALE_HIGH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I think we're going to make it - I do","We did good today - thank you","We got this far. I wasn't sure we would","Hey, I think we might actually pull this off","Look at us, still standing, that's worth something","I'm proud of you all, I mean it, I'm proud","We've had a good day, a really good day, let's remember it","Okay, I think we've got this, I really think we do","Damn, we're doing alright, aren't we?","Hey, we're still here, we're still here, that's something to be proud of","You know, I'm starting to feel like we might actually make it","Look at us, we survived another day, high five, anyone?"}},
