{"MORALE_LOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I don't know how much longer I can do this","What's even the point anymore?","What's the point? Honestly, what's the point?","I can't keep doing this, I really can't","Same shit every day, I'm losing my mind","I miss my old life so much it hurts physically","Does anyone else feel like giving up?","Nobody's coming, are they? Nobody's ever coming","I can't do this anymore, I just can't, what's the point?","Every day's the same, run, hide, starve, repeat, I'm so tired","Why bother? Seriously, why do we bother?","I'm so sick of being scared, I'm so sick of everything","I don't think we're going to make it, I'm sorry, I just don't"}},
