{"MULTIPLE_CONTACTS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"There's so many! There's so many of them!","More! More of them are coming!","I count a lot, I count too many"}},
{"MULTIPLE_CONTACTS","reg=law",{"More than one out there! Lots of them!","More than one, I count five, six - coming this way","There's more than one. Keep watching!","Several subjects, all directions, request backup","There's more than one. Don't get careless","More than I expected, deputies, back to back","Calling out four, no, five, five targets"}},
