{"MULTIPLE_CONTACTS","reg=military",{"More than one out there! Spread out!","I count eight! They're everywhere!","More than one out there. Stay careful","Several infected, sir, northwest, west, southwest","They're on three sides, sir, three sides","Call your sectors, call your sectors, more than one out there","More than a squad can handle, sir, request orders"}},
