{"MULTIPLE_CONTACTS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Shit, there's a crowd of them","More than we can handle! Time to go!","Shit, there's more, there's MORE of 'em","They're coming from all over, all over!","How many are there?! How many?!","One, two, three, four, FIVE, that's too many!","Everywhere, everywhere I look, there's another one","Cover the back, cover the back, they're coming from everywhere","It's a damn trap, it's all of them, they were waiting for us","This could be more trouble than we can handle"}},
