{"NPC_ASKS_COPING","st=friendly",{"Hey... how are you holding up?","You getting any sleep, or just lying there listening?","Been a rough few days, huh? You doing alright?","How've you been? Really, not just the usual answer","You look tired, you holding together?","Glad you're still here... how are you doing?"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_COPING","st=neutral",{"How are you doing with all this?","You holding up out here?","You alright? It's been a hell of a week","Can I ask how you're getting through this?","How've things been for you?","You managing, or barely hanging on like me?"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_COPING","st=careful",{"You alright? Don't need your whole life story","Look, I'm just asking... you holding up?","You doing okay out here?","This shit getting to you too?","You managing? You don't have to answer","How are you coping? I'm not asking for anything"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_DESTINATION","st=friendly",{"Where are you headed next?","Heading back somewhere, or still looking?","What's your next stop?","You got somewhere to go after this?","Going home, or looking for supplies?","Where you off to? No need to tell me the address"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_DESTINATION","st=neutral",{"Where are you going from here?","You heading back, or going farther out?","Where are you headed? Roughly, I mean","You staying around here?","Got a destination, or just moving?","What's bringing you down this way?"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_DESTINATION","st=careful",{"Where you headed? Just checking we're not in each other's way","You going farther out?","You staying here, or moving on?","Where are you off to? Keep it vague if you want","Which way are you going?","Are you headed home? Don't tell me where it is"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_ROAD","st=friendly",{"See anything on your way here I should know about?","How was the way here? Anything bad?","Any trouble behind you? I'd rather hear it from you","What did you run into out there?","Anything I should keep away from if I go that way?","Getting here go alright, or did you have to run?"}},
{"NPC_ASKS_ROAD","st=neutral",{"Anything happening out there?","You see much trouble on your way here?","Anything I should watch for if I go that way?","What's it like back where you came from?","Did you pass anything dangerous?","How's it looking where you came from?"}},
